Dialogue: 0,00:00:00.00,00:00:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you hate most\Nabout Fenty Beauty?
Dialogue: 0,00:00:03.15,00:00:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s {\b1\c&H009FC9F0&}always sold out{\b0\c&H00FFFFFF&}!\NI can never get {\b1\c&H009FC9F0&}my shade{\b0\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:08.12,00:00:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,00:00:09.30,00:00:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The shade range is too good.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:11.30,00:00:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t decide.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:12.85,00:00:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So I bought two shades.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:15.05,00:00:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. I love it.\NThis is my blush today.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:18.40,00:00:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it looks just like\Na second skin.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:21.25,00:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I hate waiting\Nfor a restock!
Dialogue: 0,00:00:24.00,00:00:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The only downside?\NGetting your hands on it.
